{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西營盤薄扶林道恒輝大廈發生火警，一名年約70歲男子昏迷送院後，證實不治。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_FIRE.W.TVU7.LIVEFEED.2140_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026koM7hk0m7o1792418385.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>一名男子在大火救熄後被救出昏迷，要持續做心外壓，送上救護車送院。</p><p></p><p>現場是薄扶林道22號恒輝大廈，警方晚上近9時接報，大廈有火有煙，事後見到有單位明顯熏黑，大廈有響火警鐘，約60人要疏散。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.WESTERN-2230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269nTmY8Tsyt1792420590.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:41:25.553507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:06.651841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:06.651841+00:00","content_hash":"ee7b8334477c49bb2316fe256fb441127f269865fad88a9b78d98712953b9a19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}